BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meditation in Asheville
UID:event_317162118@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261031T051933Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261101T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261101T234500
SUMMARY:Silencing the inner critic
DESCRIPTION:Meditation in Asheville: Meditation and Modern Buddhism\nSilen
 cing the inner critic with Modern Buddhism Teacher Kadam Sharon Lovich\n\n
 Most of us carry a voice that second-guesses\, criticizes and quietly unde
 rmines — not just how we see ourselves\, but how we see everyone around 
 us. It picks at faults\, sets impossible expectations and convinces us we'
 re not enough. Left unchecked\, that voice doesn't just damage our confide
 nce — it sabotages our happiness\, our relationships and our ability to 
 grow.\nCost: $12 (free and online options for members)\n[Read More and Reg
 ister](https://www.meditationinasheville.org/sunday-drop-in-meditation-cla
 ss/)\n[Become a Member](https://www.meditationinasheville.org/become-a-mem
 ber/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/meditationinasheville/events/31716211
 8/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261027T160439Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261027T160439Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meditation in Asheville
UID:event_317199399@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261031T051933Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261104T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261104T200000
SUMMARY:Peace of Mind
DESCRIPTION:Meditation in Asheville: Meditation and Modern Buddhism\nPeace
  of Mind with Modern Buddhism Teacher Kadam Sharon Lovich\nPeace is the fo
 undation of our happiness and the good news is this potential for peace al
 ready exists within our own mind.\nIn this relaxing series we will explore
  a variety of simple and practical meditations that will help us slow down
 \, let go of stress and connect with our natural capacity for peace\, happ
 iness and a positive outlook. Each class focuses on a different meditation
  that you can easily bring into your daily life giving you practical tools
  to create a calmer and happier way of living. Everyone is welcome - no me
 ditation experience required.\nCost: $12 (free and online options for memb
 ers)\n[Read More and Register](https://www.meditationinasheville.org/wedne
 sday-drop-in-meditation-class-asheville-nc/)\n[Become a Member](https://ww
 w.meditationinasheville.org/become-a-member/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/meditationinasheville/events/31719939
 9/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261030T002935Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261030T002935Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meditation in Asheville
UID:event_316697374@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261031T051933Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261107T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261107T130000
SUMMARY:Beads\, Mantras & Deities\, Mala-Making Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Meditation in Asheville: Meditation and Modern Buddhism\n**Man
 tra means ‘mind protection”.**\n*\\~Tantric Grounds and Paths\, Geshe 
 Kelsang Gyatso*\n\nMaking a mala\, or rosary of prayer beads is more than 
 just an arts & crafts project. If done mindfully\, it is a spiritual pract
 ice in itself\, and the object we create is also special\, becoming more a
 nd more blessed as we use it.\nMantra recitation is an essential element o
 f many spiritual practices\, as a way of requesting protection\, blessings
 \, and attainments. Learn how to make your own mala\, as well as some simp
 le mantras to connect with enlightened beings such as Buddha Shakyamuni\, 
 Avalokiteshvara\, and Tara.\nIncludes all materials.\nCost $35
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/meditationinasheville/events/31669737
 4/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260924T180839Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260924T180839Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
